{
  "title": "Quranic Verse for Controlling a Riding Animal (Mount)",
  "data": "The following Qur'anic verse may be recited into the right ear of a riding animal that will not let its owner ride it:\nوَلَهٗ اَسْلَمَ مَنْ فِى السَّمٰوَاتِ وَالْاَرْضِ طَوْعًا وَكَرْهًا وَاِلَيْهِ يُرْجَعُوْنَ\nWA LAHOO ASLAMA MAN FIS SAMAAWAATI WAL ARDI TAW'AN WA KARHAN WA ILAYHI YURJA'OON\nAnd to Him submits whoever is in the heavens and the earth, willingly or unwillingly, and to Him shall they be returned. (3:83)"
}
